# Age group Categorization
# Problem 1. Classify a person's age group: Child (< 13), Teenager(13,19),Adult(20-59),Senior(60+).

age_group = int(input("Enter a persons age group"))

if age_group <=13:
   print('Child')
elif age_group <= 20:
   print('Teenager')
elif age_group <=60:
   print('Adult')
else:
   print('Senior')